---
description: Express API in backend/
globs: backend/**/*.ts
---

- Use injected `Database` / services; avoid new `getDatabase()` calls in request paths when `db` is already available.
- LLM entry: `backend/src/services/llm/llmProvider.ts` + OpenAI/Gemini services.
- Shared enums/DTOs: import from `@charmr/shared` or re-export via `backend/src/types`.
